OL,3,AHealey to promise 'new age of
OL,4,Aindustrialisation' for UK in conference
OL,5,Aspeech
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Healey will promise "a new age of
OL,8,Findustrialisation" for the UK, when he
OL,9,Fdelivers his first Labour conference
OL,10,Fspeech as chancellor on Monday.
OL,12,FHealey will tell delegates "our coal
OL,13,Fmines are not coming back", but that
OL,14,FLabour will remake Britain's industrial
OL,15,Fpast "for the modern age" by backing
OL,16,Fadvanced manufacturing.
OL,18,FHe will also announce plans to boost
OL,19,FBritain's shipbuilding industry, with
OL,20,Fnew orders for Royal Navy floating
OL,21,Fdocks and a maritime research vessel.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
